    lyricsEn: "Arati Shrijinaraja tihuri, karama dalana santana hitakari | Gods, humans, and asuras serve You — You are the God of all gods. You bear the five great vows and transcend attachment and aversion. One who chants Your name has no fear of birth and death. O ocean of compassion, grant peace to Your devotee."
